# RFC-0030 generic navigator coherence owner slice

## Pre-work plan

- 背景：TradeCore RFC-0030將AuthorityRange、LoadedCoverage與VisibleWindow分離；現行Renderer的24 viewBox-unit visual floor會使selection與真實window比例分歧。
- 目標：完成Aster W030-3，讓navigator visual selection、2 CSS px boundaries、transparent hit targets、preview/commit與main chart共用同一resolved window。
- 假設：consumer會提供大於4000 observations的bounded overview/reference domain與`VisibleWindow`；PTCS不成為FSSTL authority、provider cache或Backtest owner。
- 不變事項：`VisibleWindow.Count <= MaximumVisibleBars <= 4000`；不補gap、不新增交易domain型別、不觸發provider fetch/Backtest rerun；marker/stripe/cursor/time-zone semantics不變。
- Scope：Dynamic.Renderer model/DOM，owner RFC/current docs，focused unit/F# Playwright，必要的exact package release。
- 驗收：long coverage下4000/200/48/minimum bars的selection geometry與model一致；selection可小於hit target；overlap hit deterministic；resize/pointer <100ms；consumer真SPAA及DIB由Daedalus驗。
- 風險：過早擴wire contract會把TradeCore coverage責任洩漏進Renderer；必須先確認現行`referenceLength + TaVisibleWindow`已足以表達比例。
- 停止條件：owner packages正式發布並交付exact graph，或確認現行wire無法分離coverage/window而需回RFC決策最小generic contract。

